## Relay identity
Nickname MyVPSRelay
ContactInfo YourName <your@email.com>

## Ports
ORPort 9001
DirPort 9030

## Safety settings - non-negotiable
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
SocksPort 0

## VPS bandwidth: Adjust to ~80% of your actual bandwidth
## 1 Gbps = 100 MB, 100 Mbps = 10 MB
BandwidthRate 10 MB
BandwidthBurst 20 MB

## Optional: Monthly traffic limit
# AccountingMax 500 GB
# AccountingStart month 1 00:00

## Logging
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log

## Data directory
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

## IPv6 support (if available)
# ORPort [your::ipv6::address]:9001

## If VPS blocks DirPort, disable it:
# DirPort 0